WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.233 --> 00:00:01.601
Wow!

00:00:01.634 --> 00:00:03.569 align:start position:0%
You really came
out of nowhere.

00:00:03.602 --> 00:00:04.704 align:end position:100%
What?
No.

00:00:04.737 --> 00:00:10.176 align:end position:100%
No, I was stopped
at that stop sign.

00:00:10.209 --> 00:00:12.512 align:start position:0%
Yeah.

00:00:12.545 --> 00:00:14.781 align:end position:100%
Listen, let's just
exchange information

00:00:14.814 --> 00:00:16.582 align:end position:100%
and have our insurance
companies take care of it.

00:00:16.615 --> 00:00:17.617 align:start position:0%
Right.

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:19.519 align:start position:0%
Yeah.

00:00:19.552 --> 00:00:22.321 align:start position:0%
I'm gonna get my info.

00:00:22.354 --> 00:00:24.124
Yes, please.

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:32.065
Hey, no, what--
what are you doing?

00:00:32.098 --> 00:00:34.100
What are you doing?
- Huh?

00:00:34.133 --> 00:00:35.468
Why did you start the engine?

00:00:35.501 --> 00:00:37.170 align:start size:38% position:63%
What engine?

00:00:37.203 --> 00:00:38.538
The engine of your car.

00:00:38.571 --> 00:00:40.306
Did I?

00:00:40.339 --> 00:00:43.176 align:start position:0%
Yes.

00:00:43.209 --> 00:00:45.611 align:end position:100%
I was just trying to get
the information for you

00:00:45.644 --> 00:00:46.845 align:start size:59% position:41%
from the glove box.

00:00:46.879 --> 00:00:49.582
Do you need to start your car
to open your glove compartment?

00:00:49.615 --> 00:00:53.186 align:start size:31% position:69%
Uh...yeah?

00:00:53.219 --> 00:00:54.787 align:start position:0%
Okay, you know what,
how about I just--

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:56.756 align:start position:0%
I get your insurance
information now.

00:00:56.789 --> 00:00:59.092
- Right?
- Sure.

00:00:59.125 --> 00:01:00.860 align:start position:0%
Hey, dude, no.
Hey--hey, hey--stop!

00:01:00.893 --> 00:01:02.595
Stop, stop, stop!

00:01:02.628 --> 00:01:03.663
Where the hell are you going?

00:01:03.696 --> 00:01:06.833 align:start size:41% position:59%
Uh...nowhere?

00:01:06.866 --> 00:01:08.634 align:start position:0%
Give me the information
right now!

00:01:08.667 --> 00:01:09.435
- Okay.
- Right now.

00:01:09.468 --> 00:01:12.238
Do you understand?
- Okay, okay.

00:01:12.271 --> 00:01:15.741
All right, sorry.
I--I misunderstood.

00:01:15.774 --> 00:01:16.876 align:start position:0%
I don't see how.

00:01:16.909 --> 00:01:19.312 align:start size:69% position:31%
All right, here it is.

00:01:19.345 --> 00:01:20.780 align:start position:0%
No, no, I--no.

00:01:20.813 --> 00:01:23.449 align:start position:0%
Your--your insurance
information.

00:01:23.482 --> 00:01:26.152
- I just did.
- This is a Walgreens receipt.

00:01:26.185 --> 00:01:27.553 align:start size:16% position:84%
Ohhh.

00:01:27.586 --> 00:01:28.754
Ohhh?

00:01:28.787 --> 00:01:31.791
Here it is.

00:01:31.824 --> 00:01:35.661
- "License to fart."
- [laughs]

00:01:35.694 --> 00:01:38.698 align:start size:34% position:66%
Here it is.

00:01:38.731 --> 00:01:39.699
What is that?

00:01:39.732 --> 00:01:40.700
Now you're just miming.

00:01:40.733 --> 00:01:42.602 align:start position:0%
You know what, give me
your insurance information

00:01:42.635 --> 00:01:44.570 align:start position:0%
right now, or I'm
calling the cops!

00:01:44.603 --> 00:01:45.638
- Okay, all right.
- Okay?

00:01:45.671 --> 00:01:46.839 align:start size:69% position:31%
Okay, dude, I'm sorry.

00:01:46.872 --> 00:01:48.274 align:start size:31% position:69%
I'm sorry.

00:01:48.307 --> 00:01:50.776 align:end position:100%
That's just--
that's my personality.

00:01:50.809 --> 00:01:52.445
I was messing with you.

00:01:52.478 --> 00:01:53.779 align:start size:38% position:63%
I apologize.

00:01:53.812 --> 00:01:55.314 align:start position:0%
I thought you were
gonna take off and--

00:01:55.347 --> 00:01:56.349 align:start position:0%
and flee the scene.

00:01:56.382 --> 00:01:57.483 align:end position:100%
Yeah, no, I'm not,
well.

00:01:57.516 --> 00:01:58.751 align:start position:0%
Then how am I gonna
get my car fixed?

00:01:58.784 --> 00:02:00.620 size:84% position:58%
I--we just had an accident.

00:02:00.653 --> 00:02:04.190 align:end position:100%
It's obviously not the time
or the place, so I'm--I'm sorry.

00:02:04.223 --> 00:02:06.659 align:end position:100%
Here you go.
Here it is.

00:02:06.692 --> 00:02:07.927 align:end position:100%
I mean, can you imagine,
though?

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:09.462
Yeah, that you were gonna
take off?

00:02:09.495 --> 00:02:10.763
- Yeah.
- Yeah, I can imagine that.

00:02:10.796 --> 00:02:14.867
And it's giving me chills
up my fucking spine.

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:18.471
Anyway.
Here's the real insurance card,

00:02:18.504 --> 00:02:22.842
and, uh...let me know
what you think.

00:02:22.875 --> 00:02:25.645
"Official laminated license
to fart."

00:02:25.678 --> 00:02:26.712 align:start position:0%
What the fuck--hey!

00:02:26.745 --> 00:02:28.648
Hey!
No, hey!

00:02:28.681 --> 00:02:31.617
(Keegan-Michael)
God damn it! Son of a bitch!

00:02:31.650 --> 00:02:32.783
I am a sociopath!

